<title>USA: US Airways trims fares in certain markets.</title>
<headline>US Airways trims fares in certain markets.</headline>
<dateline>ARLINGTON, Va. 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>US Airways Group Inc said on Monday it trimmed spring and summer fares up to 25 percent in certain markets.</p>
<p>The airline said it cut seven- and 14-day advance purchase fares. Round trips tickets must be purchased by March 25 with travel completed by September 30. A Saturday night stay is required.</p>
